  "body": "CNCjs\nEN\nWorkspace\nWorkspace\nAdministration\nManage Widgets (1)\nConnection\nGrbl\nMarlin\nSmoothie\nTinyG\nSerial Port\nWi-Fi\nSerial port\nChoose a port\nBaud rate\n115200\nSet DTR line status upon opening\nSet RTS line status upon opening\nUse RTS/CTS flow control\nConnect automatically\nOpen\nConsole\nNo serial connection\nGrbl\nMarlin\nSmoothie\nTinyG\nWebcam\nWebcam is off\nG54 (P1)\n3D View\nUpload G-code\nG-code\nG-code not loaded\nManage Widgets (1)\nAxes\nMDI\nAxis\tMachine Position\tWork Position\t\n\n\nX\nmm\n\t\n0.000\n\t\n0.000\n\t\n\n\nY\nmm\n\t\n0.000\n\t\n0.000\n\t\n\n\nZ\nmm\n\t\n0.000\n\t\n0.000\n\t\nY+\nZ+\nX-\nX0Y0\nX+\nZ0\nY-\nZ-\nG21 (mm)\n1mm\nxy\nZ 3mm\nZ 4mm\nxyz\nContinue\nPause\nFORCE\nHome XY\nG92 Z0\n100\n90\n80\n180\nG90\nG91\nG-code\nAxis\tMin\tMax\tDimension\nX\t0.000 in\t0.000 in\t0.000 in\nY\t0.000 in\t0.000 in\t0.000 in\nZ\t0.000 in\t0.000 in\t0.000 in\nSent\n–\nReceived\n–\nStart Time\n–\nElapsed Time\n–\nFinish Time\n–\nRemaining Time\n–\nMacro\nNew\nExport\nLoading...\nAutolevel\n🎯\nPROBE NEW SURFACE\nSet up the probe area and probe the work surface to generate height compensation data.\nStart New Probe\n🔧\nAPPLY COMPENSATION\nLoad a previously saved .probe file and apply it to your G-code.\nLoad Probe Data\nProbe\nProbe Axis\nZ\nX\nY\nProbe Command: G38.2\nG38.2\nG38.3\nG38.4\nG38.5\nProbe Depth\nin\nProbe Feedrate\nin/min\nTouch Plate Thickness\nin\nRetraction Distance\nin\nProbe Axis Z\nTool\nTool Change Policy\nSelect...\nTool Change Position\nX\nmm\nY\nmm\nZ\nmm\nTool Probe Position\nX\nmm\nY\nmm\nZ\nmm\nProbe Command\nG38.2G38.3G38.4G38.5\n\nG38.3 probe toward workpiece, stop on contact\n\nProbe Distance\nmm\nProbe Feedrate\nmm/min\nTouch Plate Height\nmm\nTool Probe Commands\nConnect to the controller to view the tool probe commands.\nSpindle\nCoolant\nM7\nM8\nM9\nSpindle\nM3\nM4\nM5\nSpindle Speed\nRPM\nLaser\nLaser Intensity Control\n0%\n-10%\n-1%\n1%\n10%\nLaser Test\nPower (%)\n\t\n0%\n\n\nTest duratio